From: yasoteien <263659156+yasoteien@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] drm/rockchip: lvds: Keep the panel after wrapping it in a bridge

Since commit b71a623598d3 ("drm/panel: of_drm_find_panel() return a
counted reference"), bind drops the panel lookup reference and clears
lvds->panel right after drm_panel_bridge_add_typed().  But the driver
then replaces the bridge funcs with rockchip_lvds_bridge_funcs, so the
panel bridge never prepares or enables the panel, and the encoder
enable and get_modes still use lvds->panel.  With lvds->panel NULL,
drm_panel_prepare()/drm_panel_enable() do nothing and the panel (and
its backlight) stays off.

Keep lvds->panel and its lookup reference, and drop it in unbind.

Fixes: b71a623598d3 ("drm/panel: of_drm_find_panel() return a counted reference")
Signed-off-by: yasoteien <263659156+yasoteien@users.noreply.github.com>
---
diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/rockchip/rockchip_lvds.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/rockchip/rockchip_lvds.c
index ef19675d1f7f..ad835160253a 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/rockchip/rockchip_lvds.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/rockchip/rockchip_lvds.c
@@ -714,9 +714,13 @@ static int rockchip_lvds_bind(struct device *dev, struct device *master,
 	drm_encoder_helper_add(encoder, lvds->soc_data->helper_funcs);
 
 	if (lvds->panel) {
+		/*
+		 * Keep lvds->panel and its lookup reference: the bridge funcs
+		 * are replaced below, so the panel bridge never prepares or
+		 * enables the panel, and the encoder enable and get_modes use
+		 * lvds->panel.  The reference is dropped in unbind.
+		 */
 		lvds->bridge = drm_panel_bridge_add_typed(lvds->panel, DRM_MODE_CONNECTOR_LVDS);
-		drm_panel_put(lvds->panel);
-		lvds->panel = NULL;
 		if (IS_ERR(lvds->bridge)) {
 			ret = PTR_ERR(lvds->bridge);
 			goto err_free_encoder;
@@ -771,6 +775,10 @@ static void rockchip_lvds_unbind(struct device *dev, struct device *master,
 	encoder_funcs = lvds->soc_data->helper_funcs;
 	encoder_funcs->disable(&lvds->encoder.encoder);
 	pm_runtime_disable(dev);
+	if (lvds->panel) {
+		drm_panel_put(lvds->panel);
+		lvds->panel = NULL;
+	}
 }
 
 static const struct component_ops rockchip_lvds_component_ops = {
